ortal described in section 76?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Produce the itemised estimate and technology proposal only\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Does 'Payments' mean the portal takes money online, or only records an invoice's payment status?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Track payment status only (unpaid/paid/overdue), updated manually by staff\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"The backend checklist includes 'Order amendments', but the scope summary does not. Are order amendments part of the first release, and who can make them?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff can amend orders before dispatch\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Which roles exist, and are there roles within a customer company, such as a company admin or a buyer who needs approval?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Three roles only: customer user, staff, admin\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Can staff manage customer/company records and users, or is that admin-only?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff manage customers/companies; only admins manage users, products and price lists\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Who can cancel an order, and up to which point?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers and staff can cancel before dispatch\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"Now that staff can amend orders before dispatch: when is the invoice created automatically, and what happens to it if an order is amended?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Invoice is created on dispatch, so amendments before dispatch never touch an invoice\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"How does the ERP stock CSV reach the portal, and how often?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Assume a daily scheduled pickup, stated as an assumption\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q2\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-open-questions-dependency\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"The 'Open Questions' section that the request refers to is not included. How should those items be handled? → assumed: Treat the questions raised here as the open questions and record any unanswered ones as assumptions\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q4\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-invoicing-payments\",\n   \"76-order-lifecycle\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"At what point in an order's life is the invoice created automatically? → assumed: When the order is dispatched\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-order-lifecycle\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Which order states allow cancellation, and who can cancel? → assumed: Customer or staff can cancel until the order is dispatched\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"sign-in\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-customer-auth-and-access\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How do customer users get accounts and sign in? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q10\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-erp-stock-import\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the ERP stock CSV reach the portal, and how often? → assumed: A scheduled job collects the file from an SFTP/shared location (frequency configurable)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q11\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"76-erp-stock-import\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If an ERP import file has bad rows or unknown SKUs, what happens? → assumed: Reject the whole file, keep the previous stock, and log or alert\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q12\",